@.str.607 = private unnamed_addr constant [385 x i8] c"I was always good at math and science, and I never realized that was unusual or somehow undesirable. So one of the things I care a lot about is helping to remove that stigma, to show girls that you can be feminine, you can like the things that girls like, but you can also be really good at technology. You can be really good at building things. - Marissa Meyer, Newsweek, 2010-12-22\0A\00", align 1
